.DS_Store
.superpowers/

# Planning artifacts. GitHub Pages serves whatever is in the branch, so tracking
# these would publish them at rquinnmit.github.io/docs/superpowers/...
docs/

# Claude Code instructions live at .claude/CLAUDE.md, not the repo root. Pages
# serves whatever is in the branch, so a root CLAUDE.md gets published at
# rquinnmit.github.io/CLAUDE.md — dot-directories are not served.
/CLAUDE.md

# Playwright MCP dumps page snapshots here, one file per capture. They are
# debugging scratch, and Pages would serve them from a non-dot path.
.playwright-mcp/

# Machine-local permissions and preferences. The allow-list carries absolute
# scratchpad paths from this machine.
.claude/settings.local.json
